## Key Concepts at a Glance

### The 5 Layers (Clean Architecture)

```
┌─────────────────────────────────┐
│     API Layer (Controllers)      │ ← HTTP endpoints
├─────────────────────────────────┤
│    Service Layer (Business)      │ ← Business logic
├─────────────────────────────────┤
│   Repository Layer (Data)        │ ← Data access patterns
├─────────────────────────────────┤
│   DbContext (EF Core)            │ ← ORM
├─────────────────────────────────┤
│     Database                     │ ← Data storage
└─────────────────────────────────┘
```

### The 3 DI Lifetimes

```
Transient  → New every time       (stateless objects)
Scoped     → New per request      (DbContext, services)
Singleton  → One for app life     (config, caching)
```

### The Request Flow

```
Request → Middleware → Routing → Controller → Service → Repository → Database
                                                                           ↓
Response ← Middleware ← View/JSON ← Service Result ← Mapped Data ← Query Result
```

