## Common Mistakes to Avoid

| Mistake | Problem | Solution |
|---------|---------|----------|
| Synchronous I/O in async method | Performance degradation | Use `.Result` is bad, always `await` |
| N+1 Query Problem | Slow queries | Use `.Include()` for eager loading |
| No input validation | Security vulnerability | Validate all inputs in DTOs |
| Mixing concerns | Hard to test/maintain | Separate controllers, services, repos |
| No error handling | Unhandled exceptions crash app | Global exception middleware |
| Tight coupling | Hard to change/test | Use dependency injection & interfaces |
| Leaking DbContext | Memory leaks, data corruption | Use scoped lifetime for DbContext |
| No logging | Can't debug issues | Log important operations |
| SQL injection | Security vulnerability | Use EF Core parameterized queries |
| Hardcoded secrets | Security breach | Use user secrets / environment variables |

